          "type": "text",
          "text": "Call the Skill tool with \"grilling\".\n\n\nBase directory for this skill: /Users/itsmeyaw/.agents/skills/grill-me\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, references/) are relative to this base directory.\n\nCreate a standalone TypeScript data pipeline script that ingests raw BMW customer feedback Excel/CSV files, cleans and sanitizes the records, enriches them with aspect-based sentiment analysis and vector embeddings using OpenAI APIs, and publishes the structured data into a Neon PostgreSQL database (with `pgvector`).\n\nThe database schema must be designed so a downstream Next.js application can seamlessly query aggregate metrics for UI dashboards and perform hybrid semantic vector searches for LLM/RAG workflows.",
